<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/nav', { activePage }) %>
<main>
  <section class="suiting-hero suiting-hero--showroom">
    <img class="suiting-hero__image" src="<%= stockImages.suiting %>" alt="Editorial photograph illustrating premium men's suiting" fetchpriority="high">
    <div class="suiting-hero__overlay"></div>
    <div class="container suiting-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-gold"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> THE ART OF SUITING</p>
      <h1>For the moments<br><em>that call for more.</em></h1>
      <p>Explore the fabric, consider your occasion, and discuss a tailored look that feels personal. The right conversation begins in person.</p>
      <div class="suiting-hero__actions"><% if (settings.phone && phoneDigits(settings.phone)) { %><a class="button button-gold" href="tel:<%= phoneDigits(settings.phone) %>">Call About Suiting <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><% } else { %><a class="button button-gold" href="/contact#contact-details">Contact the Store <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><% } %><a class="button button-ghost" href="#suiting-collections">Explore Suiting Fabrics <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
      <div class="breadcrumbs breadcrumbs-light"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Suiting</span></div>
    </div>
    <span class="suiting-hero__label">SUITING · MADE PERSONAL</span>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-paper suiting-editorial-intro">
    <div class="container suit-intro-grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> START WITH THE FABRIC</p><h2>The fabric sets<br><em>the direction.</em></h2></div>
      <div><p class="lead-copy">A suit takes its character from the fabric, the silhouette, and the details chosen along the way.</p><p>Visit the store to compare the suiting fabrics currently available, ask questions, and discuss the occasion. Selecting fabric and commissioning a finished, tailored garment are related but separate decisions; the details can be confirmed with the store before an order is placed.</p><a href="/contact#contact-details" class="text-link">Find the store and plan your visit <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section suiting-brief-section" data-suiting-brief data-business-name="<%= settings.businessName %>" data-whatsapp-number="<%= (settings.whatsapp || '').replace(/\D/g, '') %>">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> FIND YOUR DIRECTION</p><h2>A few ideas to bring<br><em>to the store.</em></h2><p class="section-subtitle">Choose the occasion and style direction that feel closest to what you have in mind. These selections are a starting point for a conversation, not a booking or a fabric reservation.</p></div>
      <div class="showroom-step-grid">
        <section class="showroom-choice-panel" aria-labelledby="showroom-occasion-title"><div class="showroom-choice-panel__number">01</div><p class="eyebrow">THE OCCASION</p><h3 id="showroom-occasion-title">What are you dressing for?</h3><div class="showroom-choice-list" role="group" aria-label="Choose an occasion">
          <button type="button" class="showroom-choice is-selected" data-brief-choice data-choice-group="occasion" data-value="Wedding & celebrations" aria-pressed="true"><span>Wedding &amp; celebrations</span><small>For meaningful days and gatherings</small></button>
          <button type="button" class="showroom-choice" data-brief-choice data-choice-group="occasion" data-value="Business & formal" aria-pressed="false"><span>Business &amp; formal</span><small>For work, meetings, and formal settings</small></button>
          <button type="button" class="showroom-choice" data-brief-choice data-choice-group="occasion" data-value="Formal event" aria-pressed="false"><span>Formal event</span><small>For ceremonies and special occasions</small></button>
          <button type="button" class="showroom-choice" data-brief-choice data-choice-group="occasion" data-value="Still deciding" aria-pressed="false"><span>Still deciding</span><small>Bring your ideas and ask for guidance</small></button>
        </div></section>
        <section class="showroom-choice-panel" aria-labelledby="showroom-style-title"><div class="showroom-choice-panel__number">02</div><p class="eyebrow">THE STYLE</p><h3 id="showroom-style-title">Which direction feels right?</h3><div class="showroom-style-list" role="group" aria-label="Choose a style direction">
          <button type="button" class="showroom-style is-selected" data-brief-choice data-choice-group="style" data-value="Classic & timeless" aria-pressed="true"><span class="showroom-style__mark">01</span><span><strong>Classic &amp; timeless</strong><small>Traditional, considered, and enduring</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
          <button type="button" class="showroom-style" data-brief-choice data-choice-group="style" data-value="Contemporary & streamlined" aria-pressed="false"><span class="showroom-style__mark">02</span><span><strong>Contemporary &amp; streamlined</strong><small>Clean lines and a modern feel</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
          <button type="button" class="showroom-style" data-brief-choice data-choice-group="style" data-value="Three-piece inspiration" aria-pressed="false"><span class="showroom-style__mark">03</span><span><strong>Three-piece inspiration</strong><small>A more layered formal direction</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
          <button type="button" class="showroom-style" data-brief-choice data-choice-group="style" data-value="Help me decide in store" aria-pressed="false"><span class="showroom-style__mark">04</span><span><strong>Help me decide in store</strong><small>Explore the options with the team</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
        </div></section>
      </div>
      <div class="showroom-fabric-section" id="suiting-collections"><div class="showroom-fabric-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> THE FABRIC</p><h3>Explore available <em>suiting collections.</em></h3></div><p>Published collection entries come from the store's website content. Call to confirm current availability before travelling.</p></div>
        <% if (suitingCollections && suitingCollections.length) { %><div class="showroom-fabric-grid"><% suitingCollections.forEach((item, index) => { const category = suitingCategories.find((entry) => entry.id === item.categoryId); const availability = ['confirmed', 'unavailable'].includes(item.availability) ? item.availability : 'call_to_confirm'; %><article class="showroom-fabric-card"><div class="showroom-fabric-card__image"><img src="<%= imageFor(item) || (category && imageFor(category)) || stockImages.suiting %>" alt="Editorial image for <%= item.title %>" loading="lazy"><span>/<%= String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0') %></span><% if (item.featured) { %><small>FEATURED</small><% } %></div><div class="showroom-fabric-card__body"><p class="eyebrow"><%= category ? category.name : 'Suiting' %></p><h4><%= item.title %></h4><p><%= item.description || 'Visit the store to learn more about this collection.' %></p><p class="collection-availability collection-availability--<%= availability %>"><span aria-hidden="true"></span><%= availability === 'confirmed' ? 'Last marked available by the store; call ahead to reconfirm.' : availability === 'unavailable' ? 'Temporarily unavailable; call to ask about alternatives.' : 'Call to confirm current availability.' %></p><button type="button" class="text-link showroom-fabric-pick" data-fabric-pick data-value="<%= item.title %>">Add to my enquiry <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button></div></article><% }) %></div><% } else if (suitingCategories && suitingCategories.length) { %><div class="showroom-category-grid"><% suitingCategories.forEach((category, index) => { %><a class="showroom-category-card" href="/collections?category=<%= encodeURIComponent(category.id) %>"><img src="<%= imageFor(category) || stockImages.suiting %>" alt="Editorial image illustrating <%= category.name %>" loading="lazy"><span>/<%= String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0') %></span><strong><%= category.name %></strong><small>Explore category ↗</small></a><% }) %></div><% } else { %><div class="empty-collection"><p class="eyebrow">SUITING COLLECTION</p><h3>Explore in person.</h3><p>Current suiting fabrics have not been added to the website yet. Call the store to ask what is available, or visit to browse in person.</p></div><% } %>
      </div>
      <div class="showroom-brief-summary" aria-live="polite"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR SUITING DIRECTION</p><h3>A useful starting point.</h3><dl><div><dt>Occasion</dt><dd data-brief-summary="occasion">Wedding &amp; celebrations</dd></div><div><dt>Style direction</dt><dd data-brief-summary="style">Classic &amp; timeless</dd></div><div><dt>Fabric interest</dt><dd data-brief-summary="fabric">Not selected</dd></div></dl></div><div class="showroom-brief-actions"><% if (settings.phone && phoneDigits(settings.phone)) { %><a class="button button-gold" href="tel:<%= phoneDigits(settings.phone) %>">Call About My Suiting <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><% } else { %><a class="button button-gold" href="/contact#contact-details">Contact the Store <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><% } %><% if (settings.whatsapp && whatsappUrl(settings.whatsapp)) { %><a class="button button-outline" href="<%= whatsappUrl(settings.whatsapp) %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-suiting-whatsapp>Prepare WhatsApp Enquiry <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><% } %><a class="text-link" href="/contact#contact-details">Store location &amp; opening hours <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="showroom-brief-note">Your selections do not reserve a fabric or place a tailoring order. Confirm current availability, price, tailoring scope, and timing directly with the store.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="suit-occasion-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading section-heading-light"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-gold"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> DRESS FOR THE OCCASION</p><h2>One suit. Many <em>ways to make it yours.</em></h2></div><div class="occasion-grid"><article class="occasion-card"><img src="<%= stockImages.detail %>" alt="Editorial fabric detail used as formalwear inspiration" loading="lazy"><div><span>01</span><h3>Wedding &amp; Celebrations</h3><p>Discuss a suit for a day when every detail deserves attention.</p></div></article><article class="occasion-card"><img src="<%= stockImages.tailoring %>" alt="Editorial formalwear inspiration" loading="lazy"><div><span>02</span><h3>Business &amp; Formal</h3><p>Explore a considered look for meetings, events, and work.</p></div></article><article class="occasion-card"><img src="<%= stockImages.suiting %>" alt="Editorial suit inspiration" loading="lazy"><div><span>03</span><h3>Personal Occasions</h3><p>Bring your own idea and talk through the options available.</p></div></article></div><p class="image-disclaimer image-disclaimer-light">Editorial photographs are illustrative and are not images of your store's current fabrics or finished garments.</p></div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container suit-guide-grid"><div class="suit-guide-image"><img src="<%= stockImages.linen %>" alt="Editorial fabric texture inspiration" loading="lazy"><div class="suit-guide-note"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-gold">A BETTER CONVERSATION</span><p>Occasion, comfort, colour, and fit.</p></div></div><div class="suit-guide-content"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> CHOOSING YOUR SUITING</p><h2>Know what matters<br><em>before you choose.</em></h2><div class="guide-item"><span>01</span><div><h3>The occasion</h3><p>Think about when you'll wear the suit, the setting, and the look you're aiming for.</p></div></div><div class="guide-item"><span>02</span><div><h3>The fabric</h3><p>Compare available options in person. Colour, texture, and the feel of the cloth can all shape your choice.</p></div></div><div class="guide-item"><span>03</span><div><h3>The fit</h3><p>Discuss the silhouette and comfort you prefer. Measurements and tailoring details should be confirmed at the store.</p></div></div><div class="guide-item"><span>04</span><div><h3>The finishing details</h3><p>Talk through the lapel, pocket, lining, and other design options the store can offer before confirming an order.</p></div></div></div></div></section>

  <%- include('partials/store-visit-strip') %>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
